{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Headwire Helper’s streaming, input and pairing: the code that serves paired devices from the Mac."}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","title":"HeadwireMacHost","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"HeadwireMacHost"}],"role":"collection","externalID":"HeadwireMacHost"},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/SessionLifecycle"],"title":"Essentials"},{"anchor":"Running-the-host","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostCoordinator","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostConfiguration","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/LaunchOptions","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/SessionInfo","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/StreamHealth","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostCounters","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostLog"],"title":"Running the host"},{"anchor":"Pairing-and-trust","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/PairingService","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/TrustList","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/PairedDevice","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostKeys","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/LinkAddresses"],"title":"Pairing and trust"},{"anchor":"Input","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostInputActor","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/InputDeviceID","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/InputInjector","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/EventPoster","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/LiveEventPoster","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/DryRunEventPoster"],"title":"Input"},{"anchor":"Video","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HEVCParameterSets","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/EncodedFrame","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/VirtualDisplayHost"],"title":"Video"},{"anchor":"Calibration","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/CalibrationDesk","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/CalibrationPresenter","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/CalibrationOverlay","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HeadlessCalibrationPresenter","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/CalibrationScreen"],"title":"Calibration"},{"anchor":"Bluetooth","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/SourceModeCentral","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/SourceModeRadio","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/SourceModeRadioEvent","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/LiveSourceModeRadio","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/BluetoothPairingAgent","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/BluetoothAgentEvent"],"title":"Bluetooth"},{"anchor":"Classes","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HeadlessCardCodePresenter","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostExchange","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostKeyring","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/SessionLock","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/TransferDesk"],"generated":true,"title":"Classes"},{"anchor":"Protocols","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/CardCodePresenter"],"generated":true,"title":"Protocols"},{"anchor":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/CardCodePanel","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/CardCodeShown","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/DisplayWakeAssertion","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/ExchangeBoard","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/TransferNotice","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/Withdrawals"],"generated":true,"title":"Structures"},{"anchor":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostLeaving","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/VirtualDisplayHosts"],"generated":true,"title":"Enumerations"},{"anchor":"Extended-Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HeadwireGATTContract","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HeadwireMacKit","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HeadwireWire"],"generated":true,"title":"Extended Modules"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"HeadwireMacHost runs the helper’s host. It listens for paired devices on the USB cable, the network and Direct wireless over TLS with both keys pinned, captures a display with ScreenCaptureKit, encodes it with a low-latency HEVC encoder, sends the frames and the Mac’s sound to each device, and posts the input each device sends back as ","type":"text"},{"code":"CGEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s. It also runs the pairing window, keeps the trust list and the helper’s key in the keychain, draws the calibration strip a device asks for, and reads the iPad’s source mode request over the Bluetooth link the Mac already holds for HID. It does not decide what a person sees: the menu’s switches, the permissions, the build and the capture display’s mode are resolved by ","type":"text"},{"code":"HeadwireMacKit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s value types, and the menu itself belongs to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"HeadwireMac","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" app. The wire formats come from ","type":"text"},{"code":"HeadwireWire","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and the input events from ","type":"text"},{"code":"HeadwireInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so both ends share one implementation. Much of the streaming and input code is derived from ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Saffsanity\/sill","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", under the Apache License 2.0.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The virtual display, Sidecar and the private Bluetooth pairing agent are compiled only into the Direct build and are not documented here.","type":"text"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/headwiremachost"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://HeadwireMacHost/documentation/HeadwireMacHost/HostKeys":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"HostKeys","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostKeys","url":"\/documentation\/headwiremachost\/hostkeys","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"HostKeys","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The helper’s own key and its paired devices, kept in a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SecretStore"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"HostKeys"},"doc://HeadwireMacHost/documentation/HeadwireMacHost/LinkAddresses":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinkAddresses"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinkAddresses"}],"url":"\/documentation\/headwiremachost\/linkaddresses","title":"LinkAddresses","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/LinkAddresses","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where the helper can be dialled, for the answer to a pairing offer: link-local IPv6 addresses"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with their interface first (the USB cable’s among them), then the network’s."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://HeadwireMacHost/documentation/HeadwireMacHost/CardCodePanel":{"type":"topic","title":"CardCodePanel","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/CardCodePanel","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CardCodePanel","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The card code’s panel: the QR on white, at whole backing pixels a module, and who it is for."}],"url":"\/documentation\/headwiremachost\/cardcodepanel","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CardCodePanel","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://HeadwireMacHost/documentation/HeadwireMacHost/HostExchange":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"HostExchange"}],"title":"HostExchange","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The clipboard and files between the Mac and its devices, for the host and the menu ("},{"code":"clipboard-and-files","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HostExchange"}],"url":"\/documentation\/headwiremachost\/hostexchange","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostExchange","type":"topic"},"doc://HeadwireMacHost/documentation/HeadwireMacHost/StreamHealth":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"StreamHealth"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/StreamHealth","url":"\/documentation\/headwiremachost\/streamhealth","navig